cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Posnic POS in research, cite the exact release or commit you
  evaluated together with these project metadata.
title: Posnic POS
type: software
abstract: >-
  Posnic POS is zero-price, offline-first open source POS and billing software
  for retail shops and restaurants. Posnic's own source is AGPL-3.0-only.
  Release packages include separately licensed components, including MongoDB
  Community Server under SSPL-1.0. Its primary API and database run on the shop
  computer or on a server you control, with optional external payment, cloud,
  and integration dependencies.
authors:
  - name: Posnic Innovations Private Limited
repository-code: https://github.com/Posnic/POS
url: https://posnic.com/
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 1.6.1
keywords:
  - point of sale
  - POS software
  - open source POS
  - offline POS
  - online/offline POS
  - offline-first
  - retail
  - restaurant
  - inventory management
  - billing software
